>凸窗晒衣,很方便</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>E.有垃圾桶,集中回收,免追垃圾車</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>F.貼心設計:獨立掀床.增加收納空間</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>迷你更衣室.可吊可摺皆宜</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>G.溫馨裝潢,一卡皮箱即可入住</strong></span><br /></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如有符合需求 歡迎看屋  喜歡價格可議  </strong><br /><br /><strong>看屋聯絡專線：0953-505-678  黃先生</strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構。\r\n本房屋近湖光市場公車站、內湖捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "內湖區康寧路一段", "lat": "25.0798230", "lng": "121.5932340", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "內湖站", "distance": 428, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約428公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "康寧路一段站", "distance": 74, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約74公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "警智新村站", "distance": 164, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約164公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "嘴大王魷魚羹", "distance": 13, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約13公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "美安電商創業加盟輔導處 內湖", "distance": 65, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約65公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "臺北市內湖區康寧國民小學", "distance": 172, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約172公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "臺北市私立方濟高級中學", "distance": 391, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約391公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "10,888元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "水費、網路、第四台", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "v